OL,3,GNEWSAAmbulance handover delays
OL,4,Aworsening across region
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest Midlands Ambulance Service has
OL,7,Fsaid delays outside hospitals in the
OL,8,Fregion are getting worse and "patient
OL,9,Fharm is undoubtedly happening as a
OL,10,Fresult of it".
OL,12,FAidan Brown, its service transformation
OL,13,Fand patient safety director, said in
OL,14,FSeptember alone ambulances lost 32,810
OL,15,Fhours (3.7 years) sitting outside
OL,16,Fhospitals in the region with patients
OL,17,Fin the back.
OL,19,FHe also told an ambulance board meeting
OL,20,Fthe winter is "likely to see
OL,21,Fsignificant further deterioration".
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
